{
 "_meta": {
  "id": "peri_up_rosett",
  "name": "PERI UP Rosett (steel, 72 cm)",
  "family": "Ringlock 0.72 m, grid 1.50-3.00 m (PERI UP, node 0.50 m)",
  "status": "draft",
  "note": "Facade scaffold from the PERI UP Rosett Modular components (PERI Scaffolding Component Catalogue ed. 10/2010): Decking Transoms UHD 72, 2 x Steel Decks UDS 32 per bay, Ledgers UH as guard rails, Node Braces UBK for a 2.0 m lift, Base Standard UVB 24 as starter. Values are catalog values; 'verified' = false until weighed/measured.",
  "units": {
   "length": "mm",
   "mass": "kg"
  },
  "sources": [
   "256895321-Component-Catalogue-Scaffolding.pdf PDF p.56 (base plates), p.57 (Base Standard UVB), p.58 (Standards UVR), p.59 (Decking Transoms UHD), p.60 (Ledgers UH), p.62 (Node Braces UBK), p.63 (Steel Decks UDS), p.64 (Access Decks UAL-2), p.66 (Toe Boards UPY), p.130-131 (Wall Tie UWT, Ring Bolt UFE, Coupler NK). Printed page = PDF page - 4."
  ],
  "approvals": [],
  "changes": [
   "Initial draft from scratchpad/out/peri.json (UP Rosett Modular + System-Independent Accessories), values re-checked on PDF p.56, 57, 59, 62, 63, 64, 66.",
   "Width 72 (axis 720 mm): transom = Decking Transom UHD 72 (for Steel Decks UDS); 2 x UDS 32 per bay is a geometric deduction (2 x 320 = 640 < 720), the catalog does not state decks per bay.",
   "Bays 1.50/2.00/2.50/3.00 m; extras 0.72/1.04 m. UDS 32 x 400 (2.0 kN/m2) not used.",
   "Guard rails = Ledgers UH (into the rosette). The 38 mm Guardrails UPG need a Guardrail Coupler UPW (0.719 kg) each end, which the engine cannot count.",
   "Open end = 2 x Ledger UH 72 + Toe Board Steel UPY 72; End Guardrail UPX 72 (7.15 kg, integrated toe board) is the PERI alternative.",
   "Toe boards = steel UPY (all lengths incl. 72/104); wood UPT-2 exists only for 150-400.",
   "Base collar = Base Standard UVB 24 (on the base spindle, 470 mm). Standards: UVR series (no UVR 250 in the catalog).",
   "Base plates UJB 38-36/17, 38-50/30, 38-80/55 with max extension 225/355/595 mm read from the drawings (p.56); swivel UJS not used.",
   "Access: UAL-2 64 x 250/3 and 64 x 300/3 with ladder (Load Class 3, 2.0 kN/m2); UAL-2 64 x 200/3 has no ladder and is not used.",
   "Ties: Wall Tie UWT 110 (reaches both standards), Standard Coupler NK 48/48, Ring Bolt UFE 12/120.",
   "max_load_class 3 / 2.0 kN/m2 = the UAL-2 access deck class; UDS decks alone are rated 6.0 kN/m2 up to 2.5 m and 4.5 at 3.0 m."
  ]
 },
